{"id":68363,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68363"},"modified":"2026-10-01T09:06:28","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T08:06:28","slug":"rfm-performance-manz-games-aveiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/rfm-performance-manz-games-aveiro\/","title":{"rendered":"RFM Performance MANZ Games \u2013 Aveiro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">RFM Performance MANZ Games \u2013 Aveiro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>RFM Performance MANZ Games \u2013 Aveiro 2026<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>7 e 8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado e Domingo) no complexo <strong>Caixa UA<\/strong> (Universidade de Aveiro), no concelho e distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. A inovadora competi\u00e7\u00e3o de <em>fitness racing<\/em> combina corrida pedestre intervalada com exerc\u00edcios funcionais de resist\u00eancia num ambiente de pura supera\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O formato de prova desafia os atletas a completarem <strong>4.2 km de corrida<\/strong> divididos em voltas intercaladas com <strong>7 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de exerc\u00edcios funcionais<\/strong> (SkiErg, Sled Push, Sled Pull, Burpee Broad Jumps, Rowing, Farmers Carry e Wall Balls). A competi\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza categorias individuais (Single Masculino e Single Feminino) e em duplas (Doubles Masculinos, Femininos e Mistos), com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica rigorosa por chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>MANZ<\/strong>, com patroc\u00ednio oficial da RFM, garantindo uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o de excel\u00eancia, ambiente festivo com m\u00fasica e total apoio aos participantes e acompanhantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/str